  "question": {
    "text": "The best electrolyte for coagulating <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> sol is"
